"it-IT","title":"Addio mia concubina","overview":"Due bambini diventano amici mentre apprendono la durissima arte dell'attore. Infatti in Cina per calcare il palcoscenico si deve sottostare a regole durissime. Una volta scelti come attori per una famosa opera con protagonisti un re e la sua concubina le loro vite cambiano. Tra intrecci politici e sentimentali si giunge alla tragedia.","tagline":"Un affresco politico nascosto sotto la patina del melodramma."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Farewell My Concubine","overview":"In an epic tale of theater, gender, love and class, two Beijing opera actors navigate political turmoil as their friendship evolves over decades.","tagline":"The passionate triangle of two lifelong friends and the woman who comes between them!"},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"霸王别姬","overview":"段小楼与程蝶衣是一对自幼一起学戏长大的师兄弟，两人在舞台上配合天衣无缝，尤其一出《霸王别姬》更是誉满京城，并约定要合演一辈子。然而，两人对戏剧与人生的理解截然不同：段小楼深知戏非人生，程蝶衣却早已人戏不分。后来，段小楼迎娶菊仙，三人之间由此产生复杂的情感纠葛。随着时代风云不断变迁，他们的命运也一次次被卷入其中，舞台上的霸王与虞姬，逐渐与现实中的爱恨、选择和人生交织在一起……","tagline":"说的是一辈子，差一年，一个月，一天，一个时辰，都不算一辈子。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e9fIRmtnI8Tis7HkwUY5Uk5QUdt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bBiZN1epQTu3F8iFLBuMhc4TRzr.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":10997,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e9fIRmtnI8Tis7HkwUY5Uk5QUdt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e9fIRmtnI8Tis7HkwUY5Uk5QUdt.jpg","language":"it","width":651,"height":976},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e9fIRmtnI8Tis7HkwUY5Uk5QUdt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e9fIRmtnI8Tis7HkwUY5Uk5QUdt.jpg","language":"it","width":651,"height":976}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/or